# cast-firebolt with a target: a fallen (monstats 19) is spawned next to
# the character, Fire Bolt (skill 36) is selected as the right skill and
# cast at the fallen by reference (scenario.md §3 rule 3), twice. In town
# the cast may be refused: that is behaviour compared too.
scenario 1
name poke-firebolt
game 1.14d
seed 0x00001234
init 644409375         # game +0x7C (tools/original-hooks.md §2): the DRLG seed
difficulty normal
expansion yes
end 120

char save ScnSor     # the save the original side loads (handoff §3)
char class 1
char area 0 1
char at default
char skill 36 1

record s2c rng units stats
snapshot every 5

at 1 spawn 19 @x+4 @y normal
at 2 poke seed-unit @1:19 0x12345678 666
at 5 msg SelectSkill skill=36 left=0 item=0xFFFFFFFF
at 10 msg RightSkillOnUnit type=1 id=@1:19
at 60 msg RightSkillOnUnit type=1 id=@1:19
